  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit states that white lotus giant silkworm Gu was created by Spectral Soul Demon Venerable. Lang Ya’s main body has no leads on it, because Spectral Soul rose after Giant Sun Immortal Venerable, when that body was already confined in the blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          708
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "creation-sources-and-formations",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
          "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
          "fac_lang_ya_sect",
          "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At Luo Po Valley, Fairy Jiang Yu uses an immense number of white lotus giant silkworm Gu as the foundation of a super Gu formation.",
        "chapters": [
          771
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "creation-sources-and-formations",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_luo_po_valley",
          "char_fairy_jiang_yu",
          "sys_super_gu_formation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Soul search of Dong Fang Chang Fan shows he used large amounts of the Gu to improve his immortal soul, with a batch still left in his immortal aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          811
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "creation-sources-and-formations",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Through an agreement with Fairy Li Shan, Fang Yuan takes that white lotus giant silkworm Gu from the fallen blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          814
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "creation-sources-and-formations",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fairy_li_shan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He then dissects the worms and feeds their meat to Cleanse Soul, which recovers enough strength to fly though it remains hungry when the batch is spent.",
        "chapters": [
          817
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "creation-sources-and-formations",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "White lotus giant silkworm Gu remains Cleanse Soul’s food and Spectral Soul’s creation. After Fang Yuan obtains the recipe, Lang Ya Sect refines huge numbers for him, and he uses many of them with rank six Cleanse Soul as the foundation of Luo Po formation for soul refinement.",
        "chapters": [
          1460
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "creation-sources-and-formations",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A later refinement batch classes it among mortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1462
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "creation-sources-and-formations",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
